    Check In L2L1 Pdcch Attach Configuration NSA SA
    Check In L2L1 Pdsch Attach Configuration NSA
#    Check In L2L1 Pusch Attach Configuration NSA SA
    Check In L2L1 Pucch Attach Configuration NSA SA
    Check In L2L1 Reference Signal Attach Configuration NSA SA
    Dated Log    **********************[Validation completed]*****************

Validation L2L1 2558-C NSA Traffic DL
    Check In L2L1 Traffic DL NSA SA
    Run Keyword If     '${param.trsMutingInBlankedPRBsEnabled}' == 'true'
    ...                Check In L2L1 Reference Signal Attach Configuration NSA SA   

Validation L2L1 2558-C NSA Traffic UL
    Check In L2L1 Traffic UL NSA SA

Validation L2L1 2558-C NSA SRS Traffic UL
    Check In L2L1 SRS Configuration Traffic UL

Validation L2L1 2558-C If TRS Muting NSA
    Run Keyword If     '${param.trsMutingInBlankedPRBsEnabled}' == 'true'
    ...                Check In L2L1 Reference Signal Attach Configuration NSA SA

Traffic DL NSA
